This plugin's rules were informed by public research and by the ideas of other design skills, without copying their text:
- anthropics/skills frontend-design (Apache-2.0): tell clusters, "the brief wins", spending boldness in one place.
- pbakaus/impeccable (Apache-2.0): operate vs persuade screens, honouring pinned aesthetics.
- MrIago/better-frontend (Apache-2.0): grounding design in the subject, decorative dots and pills over images as tells.
- connerkward/ckw-design-skill (MIT): rendering and judging the image, not the code.
- arsprengel/design-skill-claude-code: scene and direction contract before code (idea only).
- Leonxlnx/taste-skill, funboy322/avoid-ai-design, AdrianKrebs/design-slop-cop (MIT): catalogues and thresholds of AI tells.
- VoltAgent/awesome-design-md (MIT): the Linear DESIGN.md as a reference for precision.
